OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1974, Francisco Franco's regime
OL,7,     Fexecuted two men by garrote, a
OL,8,     Fmetal collar tightened by a screw
OL,9,     Fto break the neck. Catalan
OL,10,     Fanarchist Salvador Puig Antich was
OL,11,     Fone of them.
