OL,5,G0432 In the Studio
OL,6,     FMost artists depict light. James
OL,7,     FTurrell works with light, that is
OL,8,     Fthe material for his famous
OL,9,     FSkyspaces. We join him working on
OL,10,     Fhis latest, a monumental work in
OL,11,     FAarhus, Denmark.
